<ProjectLayout slug="a-parable-of-proximity">
  <p>
  Smart devices are interfaces<br />
   between humans, machines, objects, and environments.
  </p>

<p>
  Things and apparatuses are so close to us<br />
   that we often fail to notice<br />
    how they constantly exchange data and information.
  </p>

  <p>
  Could these devices perhaps even have<br />
   their own forms of interaction?
  </p>

